{
  "_help": [
    "You can edit this file by hand, or use the Map Editor at http://127.0.0.1:8787/editor",
    "while the bridge is running. The editor can search GeoGuessr and verify IDs for you.",
    "",
    "Each map has:",
    "  shorthand      What your friend may type. Keep it short.",
    "  geoguessrName  The exact map name on GeoGuessr. Used for automatic searching.",
    "  mapId          Optional. Community map ID, or official slug like world/usa/indonesia/malaysia.",
    "  defaultMode    Optional. move/nm/nmpz applied when the message has only the map.",
    "  aliases        Extra words that should select this map.",
    "  weight         Only used by the optional 'random' command.",
    "",
    "An explicit mode in the message still overrides defaultMode.",
    "Example: YB has defaultMode move, so 'YB' applies Move and 'YB NM' applies NM."
  ],
